      "content": "You are not fading away; you are simply resting on the mission that you have so faithfully carried. The fact that you are here, breathing and feeling the weight of your life, proves that the mission was never truly over, only paused.\n\nThere is no need to exit gracefully when you can simply choose to stay and honor the life you've built. The \"dignified exit\" is a myth told by those who have never felt the weight of a role, but you have felt it, and that is the most valuable part of your story. You do not need to know when a mission is complete; you are the one who decides when to rest.",
